{"v":2,"s":"m","w":1,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"The number line and signs","b":"<p><b>Integers</b> (celi brojevi) are …, −3, −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, 3, … On the number line, numbers grow to the right.</p><p><b>Absolute value</b> |a| is the distance from 0: |−5| = 5.</p><div class=\"callout\">Negative numbers are debt. Taking away a debt, − (−5), is the same as getting 5.</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"−3 + 5: start at −3 and move 5 steps right — you land on 2.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"60\" class=\"k\" /><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"20\" y=\"82\" >−5</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"48\" y=\"82\" >−4</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"76\" y=\"82\" >−3</text><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"104\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"104\" y=\"82\" >−2</text><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"132\" y=\"82\" >−1</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"160\" y=\"82\" >0</text><line x1=\"188\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"188\" y=\"82\" >1</text><line x1=\"216\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"216\" y=\"82\" >2</text><line x1=\"244\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"244\" y=\"82\" >3</text><line x1=\"272\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"272\" y=\"82\" >4</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"66\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"300\" y=\"82\" >5</text><path d=\"M76 52 Q132 6 188 52\" class=\"kc\" marker-end=\"url(#ahc)\"/><text x=\"132\" y=\"22\" class=\"acc\" font-weight=\"700\">+5</text><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" class=\"bd\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" class=\"a\"/></svg><figcaption>−3 + 5: start at −3 and move 5 steps right — you land on 2.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Adding and subtracting","b":"<ul><li><b>Same signs</b>: add the absolute values, keep the sign. −3 + (−4) = −7</li><li><b>Different signs</b>: subtract the smaller absolute value from the larger, keep the sign of the larger. −7 + 4 = −3</li><li><b>Subtracting</b> is adding the opposite: a − (−b) = a + b. −3 − (−8) = 5</li></ul>"},{"t":"read","h":"Multiplying, powers, order of operations","b":"<p>Signs: (+)(+) = +, (−)(−) = +, (+)(−) = −. An even number of minus signs gives +, an odd number gives −.</p><p>Careful: <b>(−2)² = 4</b>, but <b>−2² = −4</b> (the power applies only to 2).</p><p><b>Order</b> (redosled): brackets → powers → × and ÷ from left to right → + and − from left to right.</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"5 − 3·(−2)² + 12 : (−4)","s":["Power first: (−2)² = 4.","Multiply and divide: 3·4 = 12, 12 : (−4) = −3.","Now 5 − 12 + (−3) = −10."],"a":"−10"},{"t":"num","q":"−7 + 4 = ?","a":-3,"u":"","e":"Different signs: 7 − 4 = 3, sign of the larger (−7)."},{"t":"num","q":"−3 − (−8) = ?","a":5,"u":"","e":"−3 + 8 = 5."},{"t":"num","q":"(−2)·(−3)·(−1) = ?","a":-6,"u":"","e":"Three minus signs → negative; 2·3·1 = 6."},{"t":"num","q":"20 − 4·3 + 6 : 2 = ?","a":11,"u":"","e":"20 − 12 + 3 = 11."},{"t":"mc","q":"−3² equals:","o":["9","−9","6","−6"],"a":1,"e":"Only 3 is squared: −(3²) = −9."}]}